  "description": "A lightweight health check library for .NET and Azure Functions that runs asynchronous checks in parallel, preserves execution order and returns a clean JSON response with status, durations and optional error details.\nThe library is framework-agnostic and has no dependency on ASP.NET, making it suitable for console apps, background services, Azure Functions and any .NET runtime.",
